Made `@plone/aurora` depend on the official add-ons and the libraries they need, so an app depends on `@plone/aurora` only, besides React, React Router and its build tools. Added `getAddonRoutesConfig` to `@plone/aurora/routes`. `PloneAuroraVitePlugin()` now bundles every `@plone/*` package into the server build, and resolves the `optimizeDeps` entries that the app lacks through `@plone/aurora`. @sneridagh
